                  >verified</span
                >
              </p>
              <p class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Landlord</p>
            </div>
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-primary-container overflow-hidden"
            >
              <img
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                data-alt="A professional studio headshot of a young adult man with a friendly expression, soft cinematic lighting, warm office background, high-resolution photography style consistent with a modern corporate PropTech platform."
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC-K-ZZ89ru1SWv-PEdlTck1PFzK0rEckAq1tIhzdaNziZzV6IR6qu1yFTugsZtGCb8Gtz__AVoHptbp6WcnYRfz5gN32QFNpWUD5Kv6KGncaGDgAaFLqeBErnudLzR0tWbMVknKadoN_FU4tlBlt_sBYAWVnJm2BYHceYG_WSfoWBEkX44SZEPWF_67iBx_wS6OeBMds5keqwJWPc9myWl6dw-S_VApHflgfTATnUwhjHwDgU5Lk51nTX49yptiULVd_LkGsUjHpFe"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>
      <section class="px-margin-desktop py-8 bg-surface">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto space-y-6">
          <!-- Page heading -->
          <div
            class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between gap-4"
          >
            <div>
              <p
                class="text-label-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-on-surface-variant font-bold mb-1"
              >
                Landlord workspace
              </p>
              <h2 class="text-headline-lg text-primary">Applications</h2>
              <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
                Review verified renters and move the right applications forward.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <button
                class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant text-primary text-label-sm font-bold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
