                  Active applications
                </p>
                <p class="text-headline-md text-on-surface mt-1">37</p>
                <p class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">
                  12% more this week
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]"
